{
    "title": "Word Tiles Puzzle: Word Search",
    "description": "Welcome to Word Tiles, the unique combination of classic Mahjong gameplay and word puzzles! In this game, you'll be challenged to find hidden words. Each level features a board filled with tiles, each of which contains a character. Use these characters to spell out the hidden words and pass the levels.\r\n\r\nPlaying Word Tiles is easy to adapt - simply tap the tiles to select them and spell out the hidden words. As you advance through the levels, it becomes more challenging and requires expert word-finding skills. If you need a little extra help, use the \"Hammer\" or \"Magnifier\" to get a letter clue or the \"Arrow\" to randomly uncover three characters simultaneously.\r\n\r\nIn Word Tiles, there is a Scrabble-like daily challenge mode which is very fun and needs creativity at highest level. You will compete with others to score the highest in weekly leaderboard.\r\n\r\nWith its easy-to-use controls and challenging gameplay, Word Tiles is sure to be your new go-to game for brain-boosting fun.\r\n\r\nDownload now and keep your brain active!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Word Tiles, the unique combination of classic Mahjong gameplay and word puzzles! In this game, you&#39;ll be challenged to find hidden words. Each level features a board filled with tiles, each of which contains a character. Use these characters to spell out the hidden words and pass the levels.<br><br>Playing Word Tiles is easy to adapt - simply tap the tiles to select them and spell out the hidden words. As you advance through the levels, it becomes more challenging and requires expert word-finding skills. If you need a little extra help, use the &quot;Hammer&quot; or &quot;Magnifier&quot; to get a letter clue or the &quot;Arrow&quot; to randomly uncover three characters simultaneously.<br><br>In Word Tiles, there is a Scrabble-like daily challenge mode which is very fun and needs creativity at highest level. You will compete with others to score the highest in weekly leaderboard.<br><br>With its easy-to-use controls and challenging gameplay, Word Tiles is sure to be your new go-to game for brain-boosting fun.<br><br>Download now and keep your brain active!",
